WEBVTT

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:09.270
<b>...So we need you to sing to cure the Starwhale!</b>

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.400
<b>Understood.</b>

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.030
<b>I'll get ready to head up as fast as I can.</b>

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.530
<b>Can you come too, Cou-sama?</b>

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:15.530
<b>Of course.</b>

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.070
<b>I'll be off the ground in seconds!</b>

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.490
<b>Thanks!</b>

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>I'd like to go pick you up,</b>

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.410
<b>but we're running out of time, 
so we'll meet you somewhere in the sky!</b>

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:23.080
<b>Got it!</b>

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:23.910
<b>You betcha!</b>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.580
<b>We should find them and get back as fast as possible.</b>

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.590
<b>I have this feeling that the situation's getting worse up there.</b>

