<b>Song of the Stars</b>

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:11.020
<b>Song of the Stars</b>

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:11.020
<b>Song of the Stars</b>

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.400
<b>Aria...</b>

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.780
<b>I'm so sorry...</b>

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:27.040
<b>It'll stop hurting in a bit.</b>

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:25.910
<b>Ow...</b>

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:30.000
<b>I'm sorry I couldn't defend her.</b>

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.710
<b>We didn't stand a chance.</b>

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:37.880
<b>He must be crazy strong if he got past both of you.</b>

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.800
<b>He looked like a child.</b>

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.840
<b>He was in the shape of a human,</b>

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.930
<b>but he isn't human.</b>

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.430
<b>He's a demon.</b>

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.680
<b>A humanoid demon...</b>

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.930
<b>Can such things exist?</b>

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:51.810
<b>He's an apostle.</b>

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:57.320
<b>Humanoid demons used to exist long ago.</b>

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:02.610
<b>They are highly intelligent and use powers which are pure manifestations of desire and disaster.</b>

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.450
<b>He must be an apostle of disease.</b>

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:08.040
<b>We must take Aria-dono back!</b>

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.700
<b>You need to rest!</b>

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.580
<b>'Cuz <i>we're</i> gonna go beat him up ourselves!</b>

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.250
<b>We've got to save Aria!</b>

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.460
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.630
<b>This way!</b>

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.510
<b>I hear something from over there!</b>

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.680
<b>It feels like we're getting closer.</b>

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:25.970
<b>Get out...</b>

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:32.850
<b>Get out...</b>

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.020
<b>Humans...</b>

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.100
<b>Get out...</b>

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.560
<b>They can talk?!</b>

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.940
<b>I don't think they're actually talking.</b>

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.110
<b>They're speaking as proxies of the apostle.</b>

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.070
<b>You are trying to take Aria from me!</b>

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:46.280
<b>Get out of here!</b>

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.910
<b>Well, tough luck for you!</b>

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.000
<b>We need her to save the Starwhale!</b>

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.460
<b>Prince!</b>

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:00.550
<b>You are the worst of all!</b>

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.130
<b>I'm not the only prince here,</b>

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.880
<b>but you're talking about me, right?</b>

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.140
<b>I'll talk to you if you want.</b>

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:10.310
<b>And Aria'd better be okay!</b>

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:17.270
<b>Keep Aria's name out of your mouth!</b>

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:21.690
<b>Then why don't you make me?!</b>

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.780
<b>Calm down, and we can talk this out!</b>

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.290
<b>You freakin' madman!</b>

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:41.800
<b>Where are they, Vert?!</b>

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.720
<b>I think I can hear the apostle himself.</b>

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.930
<b>I'll find him!</b>

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.800
<b>We'll hold this one off!</b>

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:51.510
<b>Vert, Gaul, head to the apostle!</b>

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:53.640
<b>I'll stay here.</b>

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.690
<b>I'll back you up, Nanami-san!</b>

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:01.480
<b>Thanks!</b>

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.070
<b>I owe you one!</b>

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.780
<b>Transform!</b>

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.830
<b>I'm gonna beat you down!</b>

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:15.960
<b>Aria...</b>

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.420
<b>Aria.</b>

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.130
<b>Aria!</b>

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:22.250
<b><i>Verde?!</i></b>

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.090
<b><i>You're Verde, aren't you?</i></b>

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.930
<b>You can have your voice back.</b>

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.510
<b><i>I remember now...</i></b>

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.100
<b><i>I remember everything.</i></b>

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:39.940
<b>Aria!</b>

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:47.190
<b>You've gotten used to feet, huh?</b>

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.400
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.910
<b>I'm doing a lot better.</b>

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.990
<b>You're carrying Verde around again?</b>

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.080
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.910
<b>He looks a little odd for a sylph.</b>

00:05:56.910 --> 00:06:00.750
<b>He looks strangely human, you know?</b>

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.500
<b>But he's really cute.</b>

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.210
<b>He's really nice to me.</b>

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.010
<b>Right, Verde?</b>

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.470
<b>Aria!</b>

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:20.020
<b>Are you watching the people down below again?</b>

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.730
<b>Y-Yeah, a bit.</b>

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.690
<b>Those heroes and princesses are pretty cool.</b>

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.990
<b>And man, all those princes!</b>

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.450
<b>Th-That's not all.</b>

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:31.360
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:37.330
<b>I think about what life down there would be like.</b>

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.870
<b>It's fun to think about.</b>

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>You can change so that you look just like them.</b>

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.880
<b>You could probably just go if you wanted to.</b>

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:52.510
<b>I still have to be close to water like always.</b>

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:55.010
<b>And I've been chosen as the diva,</b>

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.970
<b>so I won't leave, now that the priestess and Starwhale need me here.</b>

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.020
<b>And everyone else does, too!</b>

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:16.030
<b><i>The village was very peaceful and pleasant.</i></b>

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:21.540
<b><i>But it was a little bland, 
so I dreamed a bit of going down below.</i></b>

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:26.500
<b><i>But...</i></b>

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.760
<b>I want to go someday...</b>

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.260
<b>to see the cities down below.</b>

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.350
<b>I'll do it.</b>

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:46.230
<b>I'll take... you there.</b>

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:48.270
<b>Wow, Verde!</b>

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:50.070
<b>You can talk now?!</b>

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.740
<b>I'll make your wish come true!</b>

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.280
<b>We won't tell anyone!</b>

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.950
<b>We can go down below!</b>

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:02.460
<b>Yeah, I'd love to go with you.</b>

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.960
<b>If I make your wish come true...</b>

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:10.090
<b>Will you sing for me?</b>

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.670
<b>Of course.</b>

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:13.840
<b>Promise?</b>

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.470
<b>Yeah, I promise.</b>

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:54.760
<b><i>I know where to find the power to grant Aria's wish.</i></b>

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.470
<b><i>It is how I was born...</i></b>

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.260
<b><i>My true form.</i></b>

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.650
<b><i>Aria's wish...</i></b>

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.690
<b><i>Come true.</i></b>

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.750
<b>It'll come true now.</b>

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.010
<b><i>The Starwhale is confining Aria.</i></b>

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:38.050
<b><i>The village and priestess are pulling Aria down.</i></b>

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:42.930
<b><i>I can put all of them to sleep.</i></b>

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.650
<b>What the...</b>

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:59.320
<b>What's going on?!</b>

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.360
<b>Aria.</b>

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.530
<b>Are you... Verde?</b>

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:06.120
<b>Aria... we promised...</b>

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:09.080
<b>We'll go down below without telling anyone.</b>

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.960
<b>You're Verde, aren't you?</b>

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.290
<b>No!</b>

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:14.840
<b>This isn't what I wanted!</b>

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.090
<b>Aria?</b>

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.630
<b>We promised.</b>

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.220
<b>Did you lie?</b>

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.260
<b>I wasn't lying!</b>

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.720
<b>I wasn't lying, but...</b>

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:25.220
<b>But I didn't...</b>

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:27.560
<b>Don't cry.</b>

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:32.730
<b>I'll protect your voice and your song.</b>

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.580
<b>Let's go together...</b>

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:53.750
<b>Anywhere you want to go...</b>

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.270
<b>Starwhale...</b>

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:14.020
<b>You won't stop me!</b>

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.960
<b><i>Why am I here?</i></b>

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:39.590
<b><i>I can't remember anything.</i></b>

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:47.390
<b>Who was that?!</b>

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.260
<b>I have to save him!</b>

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.910
<b><i>Aria...</i></b>

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.410
<b><i>Don't go...</i></b>

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.240
<b><i>Find me...</i></b>

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.910
<b><i>Stay with me!</i></b>

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:26.340
<b>This way!</b>

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:27.390
<b>We found a door!</b>

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:28.510
<b>Got it!</b>

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.150
<b>Aria...</b>

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.690
<b><i>Gaul!</i></b>

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.530
<b>You're the one!</b>

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:20.520
<b>My guards are famous for coming out of nowhere.</b>

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.780
<b>They're world-class cops <i>and</i> robbers.</b>

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.650
<b>You...</b>

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:32.030
<b>Don't stand in my way, human!</b>

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.540
<b>You're just a little freakin' brat, like I thought.</b>

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:40.670
<b>If you keep trying to have everything your way...</b>

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:49.300
<b>you aren't gonna live very long!</b>

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.640
<b>Let me go!</b>

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:52.390
<b>Sorry, can't.</b>

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.680
<b>It's our leader's orders!</b>

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:56.640
<b><i>It's all my fault.</i></b>

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.190
<b><i>I'm the reason he turned into that monster.</i></b>

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:04.820
<b>Whatever the reason, he's far beyond anything you can handle.</b>

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:09.070
<b>I heard he's the worst kind of demon there is.</b>

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:13.580
<b><i>He'll listen to me if I go back.</i></b>

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:18.080
<b>Except that'd mean that we'd be abandoning you!</b>

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.790
<b>We couldn't forgive ourselves.</b>

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.590
<b>Our boss would be especially mad!</b>

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.590
<b><i>But...</i></b>

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:33.600
<b>We need to save the Starwhale
and the star people, including you.</b>

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:39.640
<b>I am also an apprentice demon slayer.</b>

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:44.230
<b>If there's a way to save an apostle, I'll try it.</b>

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:49.400
<b>With the right information and strategy, we won't have to make any sacrifices!</b>

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.860
<b>Could you tell us a little more?</b>

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.660
<b>About what happened between you and him.</b>

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:04.380
<b>Aria wants to go down below!</b>

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.630
<b>I will take her there!</b>

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.510
<b>We'd happily take her if you asked us nicely!</b>

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:22.770
<b>Promise not to cause trouble, and you can come with us!</b>

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:25.150
<b>I don't believe you!</b>

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:29.780
<b>Land-dwellers reject us.</b>

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:36.780
<b>Long ago, they tried to banish me even though I didn't do anything!</b>

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.540
<b>They did?</b>

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:43.120
<b>I can't trust the star people <i>or</i> the land-dwellers!</b>

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:49.130
<b>I'm going to put them all to sleep and make a safer world for me!</b>

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:49.710
<b>Wait!</b>

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:50.670
<b>Hold on!</b>

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:51.550
<b>No more waiting!</b>

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:07.770
<b>If I get rid of every human that stands in our way...</b>

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:11.440
<b>Aria will be free to go down below.</b>

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.830
<b>And she will sing just for me.</b>

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.200
<b>So, human...</b>

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.710
<b>This is where you will sleep.</b>

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.590
<b>Hero Shinku,</b>

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.720
<b>hero mode, to the rescue!</b>

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.220
<b>Get out...</b>

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:43.640
<b>of my way!</b>

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:50.440
<b>The situation appears significantly worse than we expected.</b>

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.240
<b>There's nothing we can't accomplish.</b>

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:56.070
<b>Knights and medics of the alliance!</b>

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.240
<b>Hang on tight!</b>

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:58.740
<b>Roger!</b>

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:01.490
<b>We're speeding up, Princess!</b>

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:03.500
<b>All right, I'm hanging on!</b>

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.170
<b>Everybody's coming to help us!</b>

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.840
<b>The land diva is here!</b>

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.880
<b>Everybody, prepare the stage for the Star Festival!</b>

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.050
<b>Got it!</b>

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.800
<b>I should go.</b>

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.510
<b>This way, Pega.</b>

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:24.140
<b>Your wings may be the key to saving everybody.</b>

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:30.360
<b>Show Char, the dragon priestess, and her friends how you really look.</b>

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:43.040
<b>I'm really sorry for asking you to sing all of a sudden.</b>

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.580
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:47.290
<b>I'm ready to sing anytime, anywhere.</b>

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:53.840
<b>Besides, I'm honored to be able to sing to save the Starsea.</b>

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.680
<b>What?!</b>

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:11.940
<b>Hero Rebecca and princess of Biscotti.</b>

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.190
<b>I'm glad you're all right.</b>

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.440
<b>Priestess-sama?!</b>

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:16.820
<b>Who's that?</b>

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.070
<b>Pega.</b>

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.160
<b>This is what he really looks like.</b>

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.530
<b>Let's get going.</b>

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:28.080
<b>Preparations for the Star Festival are almost finished.</b>

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.370
<b>All right!</b>

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:31.750
<b>Stay on your toes!</b>

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.500
<b>There's still a ton of them!</b>

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.340
<b>Roger!</b>

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.800
<b>They won't stop coming!</b>

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:48.520
<b>No army is infinite.</b>

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.480
<b>You're right!</b>

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:04.370
<b>Let's go, Shinku!</b>

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.870
<b>Let's go, Gaul!</b>

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.710
<b>Heaven-shaking...</b>

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.380
<b>Roaring Slash!</b>

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.270
<b>It's all over.</b>

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.520
<b>Not yet...</b>

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.320
<b>No, it's over.</b>

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:43.530
<b>What's that sound?</b>

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:45.620
<b>It's the song...</b>

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.030
<b>of my princess.</b>

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:35.980
<b>Let's sing the song of healing for the Starwhale!</b>

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:37.480
<b>Yeah!</b>

